        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9457, 8mm Diameter Stainless Steel Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 5/16 Inch Diameter Brushed Stainless Steel Cabinet Pull is available in 4 different sizes from 5-3/8 inches to 9-18 inches overall length. The 8mm Diameter Stainless Steel Cabinet Pull features <b>adjustable center to center mounting</b>. It has a brushed stainless steel finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Stainless Steel Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9457/96-US32D</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Length center to center: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9457/128-US32D</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Length center to center: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9457/160-US32D</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 7-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Length center to center: 6-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9457/192-US32D</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 9-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Length center to center: 7-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
